Make the native Mesa context backends' exported functions weak (GLX on
Linux, SDL/native on macOS, plus macOS's dllname) so the embed library can
supply its own backend (embed/mglcntx_embed.c) in the same link while
qemu-system keeps the native one. Never both strong: qemu-system links only
the native file, libqemu-embed links both and the strong embed definitions win.

